1. Original work (GPL-2.0-or-later)
-----------------------------------

The following files are original work, written for this project, and are
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 or (at your option)
any later version:

  rastertolabel-itpp130.c   CUPS raster -> TSPL filter
  gstoraster2tspl           PDF -> raster -> TSPL wrapper script
  install.sh, build-all.sh, packaging recipes, README.md,
  REVERSE-ENGINEERING.md, tests/

Provenance statement: the filter's behavior was reverse engineered from
the vendor's official macOS driver binary "rastertolabel" (ITPP130 Mac
Driver v1.5.8.1, an unstripped Mach-O CUPS filter) and cross-checked
against the Windows driver's Munbyn_ITPP130.DDD data file and the
output of cups-filters' pdftotspl on the same printer.  The C code is a
reimplementation of the observed protocol behavior; no vendor source
code was copied.  The reverse engineering was performed for
interoperability with a printer the user owns; the legal position of
such reverse engineering varies by jurisdiction.

2. The PPD
----------

ITPP130-Label-printer.ppd is original work written for this project.
Its factual content - media sizes, option choices, defaults and TSPL
behaviour - was determined by reverse engineering the printer's vendor
drivers (see REVERSE-ENGINEERING.md).  Media keywords use their actual
PostScript dimensions for CUPS conformance.  It does not reproduce the
vendor PPD's expression (no translations, font tables or original
commentary).  It is covered by this project's GPL-2.0-or-later grant.
If you prefer absolute certainty about the vendor's redistribution
terms, obtain the vendor's original PPD from the official driver
package instead.

